      "comment": "Leading 00 becomes + (matches Android ^00 → + rule)"
    },
    {
      "description": "Italian national number, default_country fallback",
      "input": "0212345678",
      "default_country": "+39",
      "normalized_e164": "+39212345678",
      "expected_hash_hex": "3527fda1981c83fc2506ff39f2b4efe1318c6181945300a030c16cd0f7fa6ec1",
      "comment": "No + and no 00 → prepend default_country, strip leading 0s"
    },
    {
      "description": "Invalid input too short for E.164",
